/// Control inlining of the code marked with this attribute.
///
/// # Description
///
/// An invocable marked with this attribute causes the compiler to attempt to inline the code into
/// call sites.
///
/// Note that `inline_directive.Always` will generate an error if the compiler is unable to inline
/// the code. However, there are still cases where code will not be inlined. For example,
/// an inlined function will not be inlined when called through a function reference.
